Build, measure and revise a bounded thermal apparatus (@th-bench-study: 0, is #chapter, #part-of @thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer, #source "../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD", #source "../sources/Heat-Transfer-in-Fins-and-Bars-UFSC.lingua#r_3HAWSMZM80J3ZMZK362ED9E3C1", #source "../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "../microscopic/Carrier-distributions-Boltzmann-transport-and-the-diffusive-limit.lingua#r_56YMTX9EKB6BF03EA8HR0ED9EQ", #thermodynamics-and-heat-transfer "../research/A-performed-thermal-investigation-and-independent-review.lingua#r_1CSKEWRQ0E4Y7DPRWPXP424RN3") { r_3JS9RWTNYGKVFJ0ZZG8RKQN6M0
**Read:** [A Heat Transfer Textbook — Lienhard and Lienhard](../sources/A-Heat-Transfer-Textbook-Lienhard.lingua#r_7TKQ2D5YRNQ8XVHXNJQDRANWKD), complete applicable conduction and experimental problems; [Transferência de calor em barras — UFSC LABOPE](../sources/Heat-Transfer-in-Fins-and-Bars-UFSC.lingua#r_3HAWSMZM80J3ZMZK362ED9E3C1), a comparison with the described institutional experiment; [Guarded-hot-plate evidence — NIST SP 260-201](../sources/Guarded-Hot-Plate-and-SRM-1450e-NIST.lingua#r_1PP28H0Y6N7RVY89W9HSQY18E4), complete measurement-model reasoning.

Choose a modest apparatus with a well-defined thermal question: an insulated calorimeter, a low-temperature fin, or a layered sample with controlled boundaries. Prepare a dimensioned drawing, material and sensor specifications, an electrical/thermal power account and a justified operating envelope. Use suitable supervision and procedures for the energy source and equipment involved.

Before construction, predict response times, expected temperatures, parasitic losses and measurement resolution. During assembly, record actual dimensions, contacts, fastening, sensor placement and material condition. Measure input independently where possible. Acquire a transient and a steady dataset, then change one condition that tests the model rather than only refitting it.

Deliver raw observations, calibration/response evidence, uncertainty, balance residuals and a comparison with pre-test predictions. Revise the apparatus or model and repeat the discriminating case. A documentary reconstruction may establish analytical understanding, but label it as such; practical completion requires evidence of work actually performed and decisions supported by that work.

